# Slide-In Animation Test
# The only script in the suite that runs with animations on. Scripts 01-09 each
# call disable_animations and nothing ever cleared it, so this has to turn it
# back on explicitly -- and off again on the way out, because 11+ each assume
# it is already off for the lines above their own disable_animations.
enable_animations

# UpdateUISlideIn only retriggers on a screen *change*, and 09 leaves us on
# Main. Without this detour every frame below is post-animation.
goto_screen RoundSettings
wait 0.3

# Headless dt is a fixed 1/60 * time_scale = 0.167s and every command costs two
# frames, so the whole 0.43-0.55s slide-in is only three samples wide. Three is
# all there is: a fourth shot is byte-identical to anim_03 whichever way the
# waits are arranged.
goto_screen Main
wait 0.05
screenshot anim_01_offscreen
screenshot anim_02_midflight
screenshot anim_03_settled

disable_animations
wait 0.2
